OL,3,CHarry Potter And The Cursed Child
OL,4,Ccelebrates 10 years on London's stage
OL,6,FHarry Potter And The Cursed Child has
OL,7,Fcelebrated its 10th anniversary at The
OL,8,FPalace Theatre in London.
OL,10,FThe play, a sequel to JK Rowling's
OL,11,Fseven-book series, debuted in the West
OL,12,FEnd in 2016 and has since been seen by
OL,13,Fmore than 2.5 million people.
OL,15,FA total of 276 cast members have taken
OL,16,Fto the Palace Theatre stage over the
OL,17,Flast 10 years, including 45 actors
OL,18,Fmaking their professional stage debut.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/6
