OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785691094
OL,3,CHarry Potter And The Cursed Child
OL,4,Ccelebrates 10 years on London's stage
OL,6,FThere has been a combined total of
OL,7,F1,762 performances of Part 1 and Part
OL,8,F2, delivering more than 8,300 hours of
OL,9,Fperformance time.
OL,11,FThe play, written by Jack Thorne,
OL,12,Ftakes place 19 years after the events
OL,13,Fof the book Harry Potter And The
OL,14,FDeathly Hallows.
OL,16,FIt follows Harry Potter's son Albus
OL,17,FSeverus as he arrives at Hogwarts
OL,18,Fexpecting to be sorted into Gryffindor
OL,19,Fhouse, but instead finds himself in
OL,20,FSlytherin, making him feel unable to
OL,21,Flive up to his father's legacy.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
