PN,37803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785691094
OL,3,CHarry Potter And The Cursed Child
OL,4,Ccelebrates 10 years on London's stage
OL,6,FThorne said the crew were "delighted"
OL,7,Fto be celebrating the show's 10th
OL,8,Fanniversary.
OL,10,FHe said: "From the very beginning, it
OL,11,Fhas been a collective effort, shaped
OL,12,Fby the passion, creativity and
OL,13,Fdedication of every person involved in
OL,14,Fbringing our show to the stage.
OL,26,@nD@[OUnD@eO]rD@JOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/6
