PN,37804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785691094
OL,3,CHarry Potter And The Cursed Child
OL,4,Ccelebrates 10 years on London's stage
OL,6,F"One of the things that makes theatre
OL,7,Fso special is the shared experience
OL,8,Fbetween the audience and performers
OL,9,Fwho journey through the story
OL,10,Ftogether, and to have brought new
OL,11,Faudiences to the Palace Theatre to
OL,12,Fhave their first theatre going
OL,13,Fexperience at our show is something we
OL,14,Fare all proud of."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@RO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/6
