PN,37805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785691094
OL,3,CHarry Potter And The Cursed Child
OL,4,Ccelebrates 10 years on London's stage
OL,6,FDirector John Tiffany said: "It has
OL,7,Fbeen an incredible 10 years for
OL,8,Feveryone who has been involved in
OL,9,FHarry Potter And The Cursed Child, and
OL,10,Fa joy for us to bring this show to our
OL,11,Ffantastic audiences in London and
OL,12,Faround the world.
OL,14,F"We wouldn't be reaching this
OL,15,Fmilestone without the many brilliant
OL,16,Fartists, both on stage and behind the
OL,17,Fscenes, who have all contributed their
OL,18,Fastonishing talent and unwavering
OL,19,Fenthusiasm to bring this remarkable
OL,20,Fstory to life at each and every
OL,21,Fperformance."
OL,26,@nD@]OUvD@AOU}D@MO]
