OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785691094
OL,3,CHarry Potter And The Cursed Child
OL,4,Ccelebrates 10 years on London's stage
OL,6,FHarry Potter And The Cursed Child
OL,7,Freceived a record-breaking nine
OL,8,FLaurence Olivier Awards, the highest
OL,9,Fnumber awarded for a play.
OL,11,FIt has also received multiple other UK
OL,12,Ftheatre awards, and a record 60 major
OL,13,Fhonours globally, including six Tony
OL,14,FAwards.
OL,16,FThere are five productions currently
OL,17,Frunning ` London, New York, Tokyo, the
OL,18,FNetherlands and a North American tour
OL,19,F` with previous productions staged in
OL,20,FHamburg, Melbourne, San Francisco and
OL,21,FToronto.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/6
